   "stem_html": "<ol start=\"6\">\n<li>The maximum load a beam, <span data-math=\"M\">M</span>, will support varies directly with the square of the diagonal of the beam’s cross-section, <span data-math=\"d^2\">d^2</span>. A beam with diagonal 6 inch will support a maximum load of 108 pounds. What load, in pounds, will a beam with a 10-inch diagonal support?</li>\n</ol>",
